NilLoaderSDK 3.0.1

Complete third-party mapping files are not bundled with NilLoaderSDK.
The build can read agaricusb/MinecraftRemapping from the pinned Git submodule at
tools/MinecraftRemapping and emit only the lookup names referenced by SDK code
into generated source. The external repository remains under its own copyright
and terms; NilLoaderSDK does not relicense its contents.
